  "id": "confirmatory-research",
  "term": "confirmatory research",
  "definition": "Confirmatory research is research done after exploratory findings to test whether the observed patterns hold up when examined more directly. In this context, it is used to validate suggested gender-related gaze and body-image patterns with additional direct measures.",
